{"source":"lrclib","credit":"Tennessee Ernie Ford — Sixteen Tons","aligned":true,"lines":[{"start":0.94,"end":7,"text":"Some people say a man is made outta mud","words":[{"w":"Some","s":0.94,"e":1.23},{"w":"people","s":1.23,"e":3.07},{"w":"say","s":3.07,"e":4},{"w":"a","s":4,"e":4.33},{"w":"man","s":4.33,"e":4.99},{"w":"is","s":4.99,"e":5.27},{"w":"made","s":5.27,"e":5.84},{"w":"outta","s":5.84,"e":6.54},{"w":"mud","s":6.54,"e":7}]},{"start":10.14,"end":13.469999999999999,"text":"A poor man's made outta muscle and blood","words":[{"w":"A","s":10.14,"e":10.302},{"w":"poor","s":10.302,"e":10.709},{"w":"man's","s":10.709,"e":11.196},{"w":"made","s":11.196,"e":11.602},{"w":"outta","s":11.602,"e":12.089},{"w":"muscle","s":12.089,"e":12.658},{"w":"and","s":12.658,"e":12.983},{"w":"blood","s":12.983,"e":13.47}]},{"start":13.52,"end":16.436666666666667,"text":"Muscle and blood and skin and bones","words":[{"w":"Muscle","s":13.52,"e":14.087},{"w":"and","s":14.087,"e":14.411},{"w":"blood","s":14.411,"e":14.897},{"w":"and","s":14.897,"e":15.221},{"w":"skin","s":15.221,"e":15.626},{"w":"and","s":15.626,"e":15.951},{"w":"bones","s":15.951,"e":16.437}]},{"start":16.84,"end":19.96,"text":"A mind that's a-weak and a back that's strong","words":[{"w":"A","s":16.84,"e":16.976},{"w":"mind","s":16.976,"e":17.315},{"w":"that's","s":17.315,"e":17.79},{"w":"a-weak","s":17.79,"e":18.264},{"w":"and","s":18.264,"e":18.536},{"w":"a","s":18.536,"e":18.671},{"w":"back","s":18.671,"e":19.01},{"w":"that's","s":19.01,"e":19.485},{"w":"strong","s":19.485,"e":19.96}]},{"start":20.01,"end":22.843333333333334,"text":"You load 16 tons, what do you get?","words":[{"w":"You","s":20.01,"e":20.334},{"w":"load","s":20.334,"e":20.739},{"w":"16","s":20.739,"e":20.981},{"w":"tons,","s":20.981,"e":21.467},{"w":"what","s":21.467,"e":21.872},{"w":"do","s":21.872,"e":22.115},{"w":"you","s":22.115,"e":22.439},{"w":"get?","s":22.439,"e":22.843}]},{"start":23.64,"end":26.64,"text":"Another day older and deeper in debt","words":[{"w":"Another","s":23.64,"e":24.289},{"w":"day","s":24.289,"e":24.613},{"w":"older","s":24.613,"e":25.099},{"w":"and","s":25.099,"e":25.424},{"w":"deeper","s":25.424,"e":25.991},{"w":"in","s":25.991,"e":26.235},{"w":"debt","s":26.235,"e":26.64}]},{"start":26.333333333333336,"end":29.94,"text":"St. Peter, don't you call me 'cause I can't go","words":[{"w":"St.","s":26.333333333333336,"e":26.666666666666668},{"w":"Peter,","s":26.666666666666668,"e":27.25},{"w":"don't","s":27.25,"e":27.5},{"w":"you","s":27.5,"e":27.65},{"w":"call","s":27.65,"e":27.86},{"w":"me","s":27.86,"e":28},{"w":"'cause","s":28,"e":28.85},{"w":"I","s":28.85,"e":28.99},{"w":"can't","s":28.99,"e":29.69},{"w":"go","s":29.69,"e":29.94}]},{"start":28.85,"end":36,"text":"I owe my soul to the company store","words":[{"w":"I","s":28.85,"e":28.99},{"w":"owe","s":28.99,"e":31.04},{"w":"my","s":31.04,"e":31.32},{"w":"soul","s":31.32,"e":32.2},{"w":"to","s":32.2,"e":32.64},{"w":"the","s":32.64,"e":33.3},{"w":"company","s":33.3,"e":34.85},{"w":"store","s":34.85,"e":36}]},{"start":38.98,"end":42.98,"text":"I was born one mornin' when the sun didn't shine","words":[{"w":"I","s":38.98,"e":39.143},{"w":"was","s":39.143,"e":39.47},{"w":"born","s":39.47,"e":39.878},{"w":"one","s":39.878,"e":40.204},{"w":"mornin'","s":40.204,"e":40.858},{"w":"when","s":40.858,"e":41.266},{"w":"the","s":41.266,"e":41.592},{"w":"sun","s":41.592,"e":41.919},{"w":"didn't","s":41.919,"e":42.49},{"w":"shine","s":42.49,"e":42.98}]},{"start":43.68,"end":46.800000000000004,"text":"I picked up my shovel and I walked to the mine","words":[{"w":"I","s":43.68,"e":43.813},{"w":"picked","s":43.813,"e":44.277},{"w":"up","s":44.277,"e":44.477},{"w":"my","s":44.477,"e":44.676},{"w":"shovel","s":44.676,"e":45.14},{"w":"and","s":45.14,"e":45.406},{"w":"I","s":45.406,"e":45.539},{"w":"walked","s":45.539,"e":46.003},{"w":"to","s":46.003,"e":46.203},{"w":"the","s":46.203,"e":46.468},{"w":"mine","s":46.468,"e":46.8}]},{"start":46.85,"end":49.85,